{\*\generator Msftedit 5.41.21.2509;}\viewkind4\uc1\pard\b\f0\fs20 Darkshire Marsh\b0\par
\fs16\par
Living in the murky Darkshire Marsh is not an easy task. There's not a lot of dry land to build on, and the rain and swamp wildlife make things harder still.\par
\par
Not to mention that the swamp is best known for the powerful acid geysir eruptions that have become more frequent as of late. They are bound to cause trouble to even the most skilled of settlers and survivalists.\par
\par
The goal is to achieve 1000 settlement points.\par
